This program performs two basic string operations: string reversal and palindrome checking. 
The reverse function displays the characters of a string in reverse order, while the palindrome function checks whether a given string reads the same forward and backward. The program helps in understanding string manipulation, character access, loops, and basic algorithmic logic in C++.
Technologies Used: C++, Strings, Loops, Conditional Statements
* Reverse a string
* Check whether a string is a palindrome
* User input for string processing
* Demonstrates string traversal and manipulation techniques
